    "create_time": "2026-09-17 10:58",
    "content_noencode": "<section style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-style: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: justify;font-size: 16px;color: rgb(62, 62, 62);\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(160, 160, 160);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">洛洛的第38篇原创文章</span></span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">大家好，我是洛洛。</span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">各位读者老师，试过用豆包处理工作了吗？</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">前段时间测过豆包的模型，当时还专门用它跑了一轮办公任务。豆包工作能力已经比较强了，但细节上感觉还有提升空间。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">豆包近期正式推送Seed-2.1-pro-0915全新版本，同步上线Seed-Evolving迭代版本。</span><span style=\"background-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">本次升级重点强化多模态Coding和Agent长程执行能力，大幅优化搜索真实性工具调用稳定性视觉空间理解和3D运镜能力。</span></span><span leaf=\"\">我结合两千六百万电商商家的真实工作场景，搭建完整新品研发引流全链路测试。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">从竞品调研到广告六个环节，全程由豆包最新模型的 Agent 配合视觉理解主导。效果到底如何？各位读者老师一起往下看。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100004561\" data-ratio=\"0.15121255349500715\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KClxD1UK9eC4ictdz1szibbmEWA9CBQmGozB6Zf3BFJSy7rlricKfsVibcSUUUDONybLTDRZnBCJeMy3Jk7sXTbDGpnAJSia0QXVgK3Q/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1402\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 1px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">用 Seed-2.1-pro 从0研发香薰品牌</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最新Seed-2.1-pro 模型可以在火山引擎调用API，也可以直接在豆包工作上使用。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100004564\" data-ratio=\"0.6265625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCllonERkKrmGmJ1y2aZpBbapxuB9cyk8E5nFob8QNLjNOpQ1rS0bMe6Qe5Sd48d1rKjRXEfMHTicvlvGQFne1gHOBINfyEBy780/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第一步：香薰市场调研</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">市场调研是新品立项的核心基础，也是最能检验模型靠谱程度的场景。以往使用大模型做调研，普遍存在内容拼凑、数据虚构、真假信息混杂的问题，很多参考内容都是过时软文，完全没法用于商用立项。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">看看这次 Seed-2.1-pro升级之后的表现如何，我们先输入提示词。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100004588\" data-ratio=\"0.3640625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCmiasdIb9NhhVklW6zLfz0g8kDLxu4h6mx5fYjF6KooLMpNricicyufAiaF1ySmpp4EM5GnqLh8yW1NRonpVnwdOUQXgpaqRxjIibjM/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">电商调研需要大量筛选用户评价、拆解竞品信息、汇总行业痛点，属于典型多信息源的长任务场景，能够精准测出模型的真实检索和商业分析能力。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;height: 240px;vertical-align: top;overflow-y: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: left;justify-content: flex-start;display: flex;flex-flow: row;margin: 0px;transform: translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(8px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"display: inline-block;width: 100%;vertical-align: top;border-left: 3px solid rgb(219, 219, 219);border-bottom-left-radius: 0px;padding: 0px 0px 0px 8px;align-self: flex-start;flex: 0 0 auto;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100004604\" data-ratio=\"8.3265625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCkob9EwkXuOPIMtrWPpj1Ngj1NeFf4cHcEt9rxDr5jDm3iaoVsExUoSESOmia2P3hBpB4SM7tU6ICVVUsaKxfVZbs35UVp2S0nkA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);font-size: 15px;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><ol style=\"list-style-type: decimal;box-sizing: border-box;padding-left: 20px;list-style-position: outside;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\"><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">归纳这 10 条内容的共同点：主要是什么场景、什么卖点、什么内容形式；</span></p></li><li style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">基于这些发现，给我 3 条针对新品发布的内容建议，每条说明依据的是哪几条笔记。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p></li></ol><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">整理成表格，存到多维表</span></p></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin-top: 10px;margin-bottom: 10px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 100%;height: auto;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCnKPUJay3ufCiauJLnjhCWNTpptPtgxqmlK3Ml3RvSwBIjdxqXkk2n0ddg1wQZvOiaAH0qibwj2otA7BMUDcmIh5dmTeW82hEquZQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"3.18515625\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-imgfileid=\"100004594\" data-aistatus=\"1\"  /></section></section><section style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);font-size: 15px;padding: 0px 8px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">格【竞品内容调研】。</span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">注意：只记录你实际抓取到的数据，抓不到的字段留空并标注\"未获取\"，不要估算。如果遇到登录墙或验证码，停下来告诉我，不要自己尝试绕过。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;text-align: center;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"font-size: 12px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">▲上下滑动查看全文</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">本次 Seed-2.1-pro-0915 的效果确实不错，不管是调研内容还是排版都非常清晰。主要是所有内容都有出处，证据都有溯源，缺失信息主动如实说明，没有虚构内容和模糊结论。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">模型能够自主过滤平台推广软文和重复低质内容，精准抓取真实用户反馈和竞品核心参数。结合市场价位空白，梳理出大容量、长续航、简约高颜值的差异化新品研发方向。总的来说，就是完全可以直接当作新品立项参考资料的程度。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第二步：品牌官网设计</span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">传统电商新品展示页制作，需要设计、开发、调试多岗位配合，普通人很难独立完成。这个场景属于高难度跨应用长程任务，需要精准看懂手绘设计草图的细节、落地前端工程代码、自主排查页面比例、布局适配问题，能够全方位验证模型多模态 Coding 的综合实战能力。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在做香薰官网设计时，我还直接给了参考图。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: auto;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100004567\" data-ratio=\"0.55546875\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/smYNP8B0KCn9Licb5DgQ8Ph058zQDwO8Caqib557PuM8wtibZHib0wticEJGVoxStF8ajoibokYOhvJn79yIiczzfEH5viaicUDFCGBxe9H0Jicj0icIuc/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1280\" style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\"></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">可以看到，视觉风格把握还是很准确的。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section nodeleaf=\"\"><iframe class=\"video_iframe rich_pages\" data-src=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/mp/readtemplate?t=pages/video_player_tmpl&amp;action=mpvideo&amp;auto=0&amp;vid=wxv_4697929995107991560\" data-mpvid=\"wxv_4697929995107991560\" data-vidtype=\"2\" data-cover=\"http%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FsmYNP8B0KCnBRfVXC1OAo2xWyZGwqwbNIsAvEctr7JT5tCXRCZcIicwj7ZMo1iaY78Fr6oYRl975pJibKib7GaDG62NNcFChVSIvtibqOFfgfVTQ%2F0%3Fwx_fmt%3Djpeg\" data-ratio=\"1.7777777777777777\" data-w=\"1920\"></iframe></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">读者老师们，感觉这个官网效果如何？坦率讲，我测试这么多模型，这个设计是可以进入第一梯队的。全程自主完成前端代码编写和跨端适配调试，整套流程我都没有任何介入，真正实现看图出项目、识图做工程的落地效果，确实提升很大。</span></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"text-align: left;white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">第三步：</span></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">包装设计</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section style=\"margin: 0px 0px 24px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0);letter-spacing: 1px;padding: 0px 10px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">品牌物料设计最考验模型的迭代稳定性和细节把控能力。一套产品包含包装盒、瓶身标签、说明书、香调卡多种物料，多轮修改后很容易出现风格跑偏、色彩错乱、版式不统一的问题。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">商用包装设计对细节容错率极低，刚好可以完整测试新版模型的办公商用能力和细节纠错能力，贴合电商日常落地需求。</span></p><p style=\"white-space: normal;margin: 0px;padding: 0px;box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br  /></span></p></section></section><section style=\"text-align: center;margin: 0px 0px 24px;line-height: 0;box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;border-style: solid;border-width: 3px;border-color: rgb(221, 247, 203);width: 90%;height: au